{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01594","headline":"琴曲歌辞 三峡流泉歌 · 李季兰","name":"琴曲歌辞 三峡流泉歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家本住巫山云，巫山流水常自闻。\n玉琴弹出转寥敻，直似当时梦中听。\n三峡流泉几千里，一时流入深闺里。\n巨石奔崖指下生，飞波走浪弦中起。\n初疑喷涌含雷风，又似呜咽流不通。\n回湍曲濑势将尽，时复滴沥平沙中。\n忆昔阮公爲此曲，能使仲容听不足。\n一弹既罢复一弹，愿似流泉镇相续。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李季兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}